Section 7 implementation for Mother's Love TV (Participation Status, renderer id 6) is complete and ready for the coordinator verification run.

The Participation Status scene now provides three distinct seeded motion vocabularies (float, sway, and breathe with occasional 1.1 second lifts) across the nine expression medallions, while keeping all numbers static. An ambient diagonal light sweep and offset card glow pulses have been added in CSS with complete safeguards for reduced motion and still mode. A full Playwright specification has been created to test circularity, layout bounds, motion vocabularies, waveforms, ambient animation activation, and envelope constraints over 30 seconds.

### Summary of changes

1. [`public/color-polish/scenes/status.js`](file:///Users/anthony/.claude/worktrees/mothers-love-tv-status/public/color-polish/scenes/status.js): Seeded motion vocabularies by index (`float`, `sway`, `breathe`), stored `kind` on actors, wrote `data-motion` attributes to medallions, initialized `nextLift` schedules, and branched `tickStatus` with distinct waveforms.
2. [`public/color-polish/scenes/status.css`](file:///Users/anthony/.claude/worktrees/mothers-love-tv-status/public/color-polish/scenes/status.css): Added scoped rules under `#tv .scene[data-scene="6"]` for `.expression-stats` overflow clipping, card relative positioning, a 22 second diagonal light sweep pseudo-element, and 9 second card glow pulses with staggered `nth-child` delays, wrapped in `@media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference)` and disabled under `#tv.still`.
3. [`tests/color-polish-scenes/status.spec.ts`](file:///Users/anthony/.claude/worktrees/mothers-love-tv-status/tests/color-polish-scenes/status.spec.ts): Added five Playwright tests covering medallion circularity, lack of overflow, three motion vocabularies, pairwise distinct icon transforms with opposing rotation deltas, ambient sweep activation under motion and suppression under reduced motion, and strict motion envelope compliance (translate <= 6 px, rotate <= 7 deg, scale 0.97 to 1.03) across 30 seconds.
4. [`docs/runs/2026-09-11-tv-scenes/lanes/status.md`](file:///Users/anthony/.claude/worktrees/mothers-love-tv-status/docs/runs/2026-09-11-tv-scenes/lanes/status.md): Generated the lane record documenting all modified files, resolved gap items, and verification status.

